- To start the backend:

  - use dotnet version 9
  - cd into `./API/` and run `dotnet run`
  - use `http://localhost:7284` and check `https://localhost:7284/api/user/public` endpoint
  - run `export GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS="/Users/nikolainechaev/Desktop/practice/LoadboardNov24/LoadBoard2025/API/Configs/firebase-adminsdk.json"' >> ~/.zshrc`

